+P1_SMT_CONV_LABEL
+p1_smt_drv_conv
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_HELP
+Convert the default body using one selected planar driving face.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_DESC
+Controlled driving conversion; input mm; modifies model; never saves.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_TEXT
+%0s
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NO_MODEL
+No active model. Open a part and retry.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NOT_PART
+Only an active part is supported; assemblies and drawings are rejected.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NO_BODY
+No usable default solid body. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_ALREADY
+Default body is already sheetmetal; no repeated conversion.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_SELECT
+Select one planar surface belonging to the default body.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NO_FACE
+No surface selected. Select one planar driving surface and retry.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_ONE_FACE
+Select exactly one surface. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_BAD_FACE
+Invalid surface or geometry query failed. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_BODY_MISMATCH
