+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NOT_PLANE
+6A supports planar driving surfaces only. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_THICKNESS
+Enter thickness in mm, 0.1 to 20.0. Press ESC to cancel.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_BAD_THICKNESS
+Enter a valid thickness in mm from 0.1 to 20.0.
+#
+#
