+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_SUCCESS
+Driving conversion readback passed. Sheetmetal is true. No Save.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_MODEL_NAME
+Model name:
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_FEATURE_NAME
+Feature name:
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_BUSY
+Conversion command is already active; wait for it to return.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_EXCEPTION
+Command exception. Inspect model and JSONL before retry; no Save.
