+P1_SMT_CONV_LABEL
+p1_smt_drv_conv
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_HELP
+Convert the default body using one selected planar driving face.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_DESC
+Controlled driving conversion; input mm; modifies model; never saves.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_TEXT
+%0s
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NO_MODEL
+No active model. Open a part and retry.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NOT_PART
+Only an active part is supported; assemblies and drawings are rejected.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NO_BODY
+No usable default solid body. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_ALREADY
+Default body is already sheetmetal; no repeated conversion.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_SELECT
+Select one planar surface belonging to the default body.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NO_FACE
+No surface selected. Select one planar driving surface and retry.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_ONE_FACE
+Select exactly one surface. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_BAD_FACE
+Invalid surface or geometry query failed. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_BODY_MISMATCH
+Surface is not confirmed in the default body. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_NOT_PLANE
+6A supports planar driving surfaces only. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_THICKNESS
+Enter thickness in mm, 0.1 to 20.0. Press ESC to cancel.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_BAD_THICKNESS
+Enter a valid thickness in mm from 0.1 to 20.0.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_CANCELLED
+Cancelled before creation. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_STALE
+Model or default body changed. No feature was created; retry selection.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_UNIT_FAILED
+Could not confirm mm to current model units. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_QUERY_FAILED
+Model or body query failed. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_TREE_FAILED
+Element tree preparation failed. No feature was created.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_READ_ONLY
+Creo refused modification. Inspect model state and JSONL; no Save.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_CREATE_FAILED
+Creation failed. Model may have changed. Inspect JSONL; no Save.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_POST_FAILED
+Post-create check failed. Inspect the model and JSONL. No Save.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_SUCCESS
+Driving conversion readback passed. Sheetmetal is true. No Save.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_MODEL_NAME
+Model name:
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_FEATURE_NAME
+Feature name:
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_BUSY
+Conversion command is already active; wait for it to return.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_EXCEPTION
+Command exception. Inspect model and JSONL before retry; no Save.
+#
+#
+P1_SMT_CONV_WRAP_FAILED
+Could not wrap the current part or default body. Create was not called.
+#
+#
